# The example inputs are generated by make_examples.py, which fetches every sequence from
# UniProt by accession. The generator is the artefact worth keeping; the files it writes are
# not, and committing them would mean a pasted sequence that can silently drift from the
# accession it claims to be.
#
# To rebuild them:  python3 make_examples.py
